WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.380
Hi guys, I just got back from Cincinnati.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.440
Uh, from that sudden trip that I told you guys about, the day before I left.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.800
So, if I look a little frazzled it's because I've had, like, six hours of sleep in the past 48 hours.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.180
Um...first off, just thank you guys so much for all the birthday wishes yesterday.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.040
Uh...thank you for helping me celebrate the big 3-0.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.320
Thank you for 24 million subscribers,like, that came out of nowhere too.

00:00:22.359 --> 00:00:26.069
Umm... but I wanted to talk about why I was in

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.710
Cincinnati yesterday.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.240
Yesterday

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.829
was

00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:35.189
Tyler's mom's memorial service.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:39.840
If you don't know Tyler, Tyler's the guy who's been helping me make videos.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.180
He's been in Markiplier makes, like, this is Tyler.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:47.400
Tyler's mom, Cindy, passed away about a month ago.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.320
And the service was just yesterday. That's why I flew in,

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.520
'Cuz I promised him I would be there and of course I'd be there.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:03.860
So, I'm telling you this now and not before because I... I just,

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.520
I didn't want anyone to show up to the memorial service,

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:11.840
out of the blue. Like, uh... I just didn't want that to happen.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:18.720
Umm... you know, because I wanted to give, like, the family the most space possible and like be as supportive as I can.

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:22.420
From a distance, but you know, Tyler, he's- he's a friend of mine.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:28.580
So I have a favor to ask of you guys, if you are willing to help out.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.960
Um... if you can send him

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:32.940
some love.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:37.400
Send him some support. Send him and his entire family some support.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.760
I hate to say it, but I did not even know Cindy that well.

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:43.530
Like I knew her, and I've known her for a long time,

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:45.530
but I never really got to know her, and it's-

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:52.120
It's terrible that at her memorial is when I learned so much about her and what an amazing person she was.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.680
I've actually told this story before,

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.040
Uh... but I've left out a crucial detail.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.639
I- I've talked about the first time I had surgery, I got my tumor removed.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:06.900
It was a very painful recovery process because they got my medication wrong.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:11.900
Basically, from the time I had the surgery until the next morning,

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:19.000
I was in incredible pain because they got my pain medication wrong. The only reason that got fixed is because

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:23.749
Tyler's mom works in the pharmacy at the hospital that I was at.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:29.270
She wasn't there when I was first admitted, so she comes in on her morning shift or, whenever it was, and

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.700
she knows that I'm there.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:35.959
She had no reason to really know who I was or like, really care all that much,

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:40.600
but that's just the type of person that she was. She came in and she

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:46.000
checked up on me. She checked my file and she saw immediately that there was a problem.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.040
(inhale)

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:51.320
So she fixed it. Like, the only reason that

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:56.760
I had my pain finally managed is because she went out of her way

00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:01.440
to help someone that she only knew because I was a friend of her son's.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.000
(Pause)

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:07.220
And that's just the kind of person that she was. And it was- and it was like, that story is

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.540
nothing

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.260
compared to the stories that people were telling about her.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:17.200
So, please send Tyler all the love in the world that you can. Send his family stuff

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.020
I'll provide links to his Twitter in the description below.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:25.780
um... just send messages of good will because I know there's nothing that, like, you and I could say

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:26.520
(Another inhale)

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.520
to make it better,

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.160
but...

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:31.020
you know.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:32.260
I know...

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:33.660
(Pause)

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:38.620
I-I don't want to ma- I-I don't want to make this about me in any way shape or form because it is not about me.

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:41.140
But I know what it's like to lose a parent.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.240
(Pause and inhale)

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.560
And it's never easy. What I want is to...

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:47.600
(Pause)

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.600
... have as much support there for him as possible.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:52.300
(Lip smack)

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:57.620
If you can send him a message, send him some love, send him anything, just-

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:03.220
You don't have to. There's no obligation to do this, but if you want to reach out, do.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.720
I think it would make the world a difference.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:06.680
(Inhale)

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.220
There's unfortunately, um...

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:16.800
I hate to pile on bad news one on top of the other, but I was back in Cincinnati talking to my stepmom.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:19.020
And uh...

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:26.900
You know, she told me about her nephew Jay, who I'd only met three, four times in my entire life.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:32.180
I never really knew him, but he was part of my stepmom's family and I care about my stepmom very much.

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:33.080
So...

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:37.940
She told me that Jay, was killed.

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:39.680
Um...

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:44.300
He was shot. He works in security, aand, you know

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:52.320
He was shot. There is a- a GoFundMe set up because Jay was a single dad of

00:04:53.100 --> 00:05:00.320
three kids. Basically what's gonna happen with the money, is the money is gonna go into a trust. It's gonna pay for those kids' education.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:04.340
There's no obligation to help, but I made a promise that I would let you guys know.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:08.780
If you want, there's a link in the description that goes to the GoFundMe.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.620
Please give if you can,

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.840
There's no obligation. I wish that I had,

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:18.060
like, a- good ending for this video.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.050
A happy ending or- or something like that,

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.100
but I don't.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.520
Sometimes life just really sucks,

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:33.760
(Inhale) And, the only thing that we can do, even if it's a stranger reaching out to someone that they have never known,

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:36.560
is show your support.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.570
Send some love.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:44.600
Send some good will and try to make someone's day just a little bit brighter.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:49.540
So if you can, please do, and thank you so much.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.880
I will get back into making videos obviously.

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:57.880
I don't want anyone to make this about me in any way shape or form. Do not go

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:01.940
"Oh, I feel so bad for Mark." This has nothing to do with me.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:06.300
I mean, it's my friend and it's my family, but this is not about me.

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:11.840
This is about the people that are hurting. This is about the family that was torn apart. This is about Tyler,

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:17.600
(Inhale) my friend who is in pain right now, pain that I know very well.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:22.780
And he could use some love right now and my stepmoms family could use a lot of love right now.

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:28.060
So please send whatever you can. I will get back into the swing of things as soon as I get a little sleep.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.180
And thank you everybody so much for watching.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:34.100
And I'll see you in the next one. Bye.

